1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,686
Video ya leo ni nini? Ni muhtasari wa sarufi ya N5.

2
00:00:07,308 --> 00:00:16,290
Katika sehemu fulani ya video, utaulizwa swali kwa Kijapani. Ukishasikia, tafadhali ujibu katika maoni.

3
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:19,718
Sehemu ya 1: Chakula Unachopenda na Mipango ya Chakula cha Mchana

4
00:00:19,718 --> 00:00:26,518
Suzuki-san, katika vyakula vya Kijapani, unapenda nini zaidi?

5
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:31,212
Ninapenda sushi zaidi.

6
00:00:31,236 --> 00:00:33,814
Tanaka-san, wewe je?

7
00:00:33,837 --> 00:00:39,437
Mimi napenda ramen zaidi kuliko sushi.

8
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:43,678
Haswa, napenda ramen ya shoyu.

9
00:00:43,701 --> 00:00:47,572
Ramen ya shoyu ni tamu sana, kweli.

10
00:00:47,596 --> 00:00:51,962
Mimi pia napenda ramen ya miso.

11
00:00:51,985 --> 00:00:55,752
Ramen ya miso pia ni nzuri.

12
00:00:55,775 --> 00:01:00,868
Suzuki-san, umekula chakula cha mchana tayari?

13
00:01:00,892 --> 00:01:04,825
Hapana, sijala bado.

14
00:01:04,848 --> 00:01:08,288
Tanaka-san, wewe umekula tayari?

15
00:01:08,312 --> 00:01:12,926
Hapana, mimi pia sijala bado.

16
00:01:12,950 --> 00:01:18,083
Je, twende dukani ya ramen karibu na kituo cha treni?

17
00:01:18,106 --> 00:01:20,377
Sawa, nzuri sana.

18
00:01:20,401 --> 00:01:23,834
Je, hiyo ni duka maarufu?

19
00:01:23,857 --> 00:01:27,824
Ndiyo, walionekana katika televisheni.

20
00:01:27,847 --> 00:01:32,580
Kwa kawaida, kuna watu wengi wanangoja.

21
00:01:32,603 --> 00:01:36,537
Mchana wa wiki, hawako watu wengi.

22
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:40,365
Labda tutaweza kuingia haraka.

23
00:01:40,388 --> 00:01:42,421
Ndiyo hivyo.

24
00:01:42,444 --> 00:01:45,678
Basi, twende sasa hivi.

25
00:01:45,701 --> 00:01:48,834
Nitakwenda kwa gari langu.

26
00:01:48,857 --> 00:01:50,509
Asante sana.

27
00:01:50,533 --> 00:01:54,032
Tanaka-san, unaweza kuendesha vizuri?

28
00:01:54,055 --> 00:01:55,791
Ndiyo.

29
00:01:55,815 --> 00:02:00,782
Ninaendesha kila siku, kwa hiyo nina uwezo mzuri.

30
00:02:00,805 --> 00:02:03,176
Hakuna matata.

31
00:02:03,199 --> 00:02:05,657
Hiyo inanipa faraja.

32
00:02:05,681 --> 00:02:12,647
Mimi sijui kabisa kuendesha, kwa hiyo nakupenda.

33
00:02:12,670 --> 00:02:16,037
Suzuki-san, huna gari?

34
00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:19,426
Hapana, sina.

35
00:02:19,449 --> 00:02:23,383
Kila wakati naenda kwa treni na basi.

36
00:02:23,406 --> 00:02:29,039
Aa, naona bango la duka la ramen huko.

37
00:02:29,062 --> 00:02:31,197
Kweli ndivyo.

38
00:02:31,220 --> 00:02:34,994
Je, ni duka lenye bango la buluu?

39
00:02:35,017 --> 00:02:38,184
Ndiyo, ndilo.

40
00:02:38,207 --> 00:02:42,340
Kuna eneo la kuparkia mbele ya duka.

41
00:02:42,363 --> 00:02:48,260
Leo gari ni chache, kwa hiyo tutaweza kupakia kwa urahisi.

42
00:02:48,284 --> 00:02:50,250
Vizuri.

43
00:02:50,273 --> 00:02:55,078
Nina njaa sana, kwa hiyo nataka kula sana.

44
00:02:55,102 --> 00:02:59,944
Ndiyo, tuagize ramen kubwa.

45
00:02:59,967 --> 00:03:07,072
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kufutwa bila tahadhari.

46
00:03:07,072 --> 00:03:10,072
Sehemu ya 2: Jinsi ya Kutumia Siku ya Pumziko

47
00:03:10,072 --> 00:03:15,639
Suzuki-san, unapenda kufanya nini siku za pumziko?

48
00:03:15,662 --> 00:03:20,795
Napenda kutazama filamu nyumbani.

49
00:03:20,818 --> 00:03:23,290
Tanaka-san, wewe je?

50
00:03:23,313 --> 00:03:29,157
Mimi napenda kusafiri kwenda Kyoto na marafiki.

51
00:03:29,181 --> 00:03:32,147
Kyoto ni ya kuvutia.

52
00:03:32,170 --> 00:03:34,304
Kyoto, basi?

53
00:03:34,327 --> 00:03:36,093
Sawa, nzuri sana.

54
00:03:36,116 --> 00:03:41,367
Kyoto ina mahekalu ya kale mengi, sivyo?

55
00:03:41,391 --> 00:03:47,243
Ndiyo, Suzuki, umewahi kwenda Kyoto?

56
00:03:47,266 --> 00:03:52,717
Hapana, sijawahi kwenda hata mara moja.

57
00:03:52,741 --> 00:03:55,274
Ningependa kwenda siku moja.

58
00:03:55,297 --> 00:03:59,387
Je, tutaenda likizo ijayo?

59
00:03:59,410 --> 00:04:02,977
Kwa shinkansen utachelewa kidogo tu.

60
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,414
Shinkansen?

61
00:04:05,437 --> 00:04:10,370
Inachukua saa ngapi kutoka Tokyo hadi Kyoto?

62
00:04:10,393 --> 00:04:13,560
Inachukua saa mbili na nusu hivi.

63
00:04:13,583 --> 00:04:15,949
Ni haraka sana!

64
00:04:15,972 --> 00:04:20,506
Saa mbili na nusu? Ni haraka kweli!

65
00:04:20,529 --> 00:04:24,866
Lakini shinkansen ni ghali kidogo, sivyo?

66
00:04:24,889 --> 00:04:28,223
Ndiyo, ni ghali kidogo.

67
00:04:28,246 --> 00:04:34,846
Lakini shinkansen ni haraka na rahisi zaidi kuliko basi ya kasi.

68
00:04:34,868 --> 00:04:36,645
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

69
00:04:36,669 --> 00:04:40,302
Utaketi wapi Kyoto?

70
00:04:40,325 --> 00:04:44,658
Mimi huwa naketi kwenye hoteli za kijadi.

71
00:04:44,681 --> 00:04:48,448
Chakula cha hoteli za kijadi ni tamu sana!

72
00:04:48,471 --> 00:04:52,110
Hoteli za kijadi? Ni nzuri!

73
00:04:52,134 --> 00:04:58,545
Napenda majengo ya kale ya Japani, kwa hiyo nina hamu.

74
00:04:58,568 --> 00:05:02,801
Kuna bustani nzuri karibu na hoteli za kijadi pia.

75
00:05:02,824 --> 00:05:05,624
Ningependa kuona kwa hakika.

76
00:05:05,647 --> 00:05:10,134
Wamesema kuwa majira ya vuli Kyoto, majani ya miti huwa mekundu na mazuri.

77
00:05:10,158 --> 00:05:13,841
Ndiyo, ni mazuri sana.

78
00:05:13,864 --> 00:05:20,197
Lakini majira ya vuli, watu huwa wengi sana, kwa hiyo ni vigumu kupata nafasi.

79
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:22,238
Ndiyo hivyo.

80
00:05:22,262 --> 00:05:26,934
Basi, ni bora tutengeneze mipango mapema.

81
00:05:26,958 --> 00:05:29,691
Ndiyo, tutafanye hivyo.

82
00:05:29,714 --> 00:05:34,647
Kesho nitatafuta habari za hoteli hizo.

83
00:05:34,670 --> 00:05:36,723
Asante kwa msaada wako.

84
00:05:36,747 --> 00:05:39,444
Ninafurahi sana.

85
00:05:39,468 --> 00:05:49,150
Kama umeelewa, tafadhali ujibu kwa maoni.

86
00:05:49,150 --> 00:05:52,150
Sehemu ya 3: Utangulizi wa Mfuko Mpya

87
00:05:52,150 --> 00:05:56,883
Suzuki, mfuko huo ni mpya?

88
00:05:56,906 --> 00:05:59,839
Ulinunua jana?

89
00:05:59,862 --> 00:06:01,517
Ndiyo.

90
00:06:01,541 --> 00:06:06,559
Ndiyo, nilinunua jana katika duka la rejareja.

91
00:06:06,583 --> 00:06:09,186
Ni mzuri sana!

92
00:06:09,209 --> 00:06:12,891
Mfuko huo ulinunuliwa bei gani?

93
00:06:12,914 --> 00:06:15,748
Nilinunua kwa shilingi ishirini elfu.

94
00:06:15,771 --> 00:06:18,771
Ilikuwa ghali kidogo.

95
00:06:18,794 --> 00:06:21,074
Shilingi ishirini elfu?

96
00:06:21,097 --> 00:06:23,730
Ni ghali kidogo.

97
00:06:23,753 --> 00:06:27,487
Lakini unaonekana mwepesi.

98
00:06:27,510 --> 00:06:32,514
Ndiyo, ni mwepesi na rahisi kutumia.

99
00:06:32,537 --> 00:06:36,104
Kuna mifuko mingi ndani yake.

100
00:06:36,127 --> 00:06:39,538
Mifuko mingi ni rahisi kwa matumizi.

101
00:06:39,562 --> 00:06:43,095
Mimi pia ninahitaji mfuko mpya.

102
00:06:43,118 --> 00:06:47,006
Tanaka, unataka mfuko wa aina gani?

103
00:06:47,029 --> 00:06:49,429
Ni kwa ajili ya kazi?

104
00:06:49,452 --> 00:06:53,852
Ninahitaji mfuko wa kazi.

105
00:06:53,875 --> 00:06:57,709
Ninahitaji mfuko unaoweza kuingiza kompyuta kubwa.

106
00:06:57,732 --> 00:07:02,565
Je, tutaenda dukani sawa na yangu?

107
00:07:02,588 --> 00:07:06,445
Huko kuna maduka mengi ya mifuko.

108
00:07:06,468 --> 00:07:08,435
Sawa, nzuri sana.

109
00:07:08,458 --> 00:07:12,025
Duka hilo liko wapi?

110
00:07:12,048 --> 00:07:15,122
Liko karibu na stesheni ya Shinjuku.

111
00:07:15,145 --> 00:07:18,427
Ni dakika tano tu kutoka stesheni kwa miguu.

112
00:07:18,451 --> 00:07:21,818
Shinjuku iko karibu na ofisi yangu.

113
00:07:21,841 --> 00:07:25,140
Nina mpango wa kwenda wiki hii.

114
00:07:25,164 --> 00:07:32,434
Asubuhi ya Jumamosi hakuna watu wengi, hivyo ni rahisi kununua.

115
00:07:32,457 --> 00:07:34,125
Sawa.

116
00:07:34,148 --> 00:07:37,382
Nitaamua kwenda asubuhi ya Jumamosi.

117
00:07:37,404 --> 00:07:40,571
Natumai utapata mfuko mzuri.

118
00:07:40,594 --> 00:07:42,245
Ndiyo.

119
00:07:42,269 --> 00:07:44,669
Aa, Suzuki-san.

120
00:07:44,692 --> 00:07:48,730
Je, mfuko unao karibu na huu ni nini?

121
00:07:48,753 --> 00:07:53,519
Hii ni zawadi niliyopewa jana na rafiki yangu.

122
00:07:53,542 --> 00:07:56,676
Ni keki kutoka Hokkaido.

123
00:07:56,699 --> 00:07:59,517
Keki za Hokkaido?

124
00:07:59,540 --> 00:08:01,216
Sawa, nzuri sana.

125
00:08:01,239 --> 00:08:05,172
Hokkaido ina keki tamu nyingi.

126
00:08:05,195 --> 00:08:08,462
Je, unataka moja, Tanaka-san?

127
00:08:08,485 --> 00:08:11,335
Zinakuwa tamu sana.

128
00:08:11,358 --> 00:08:12,958
Asante sana.

129
00:08:12,982 --> 00:08:17,215
Basi, nitakula pamoja na chai moto.

130
00:08:17,238 --> 00:08:20,238
Sehemu ya 4: Hali ya Hewa na Kuahirisha Tennis

131
00:08:20,238 --> 00:08:25,474
Suzuki-san, umeangalia utabiri wa hali ya hewa ya kesho?

132
00:08:25,497 --> 00:08:29,064
Hapana, sijuiangalia bado.

133
00:08:29,088 --> 00:08:31,772
Kesho itakuwa na jua?

134
00:08:31,795 --> 00:08:36,995
Hapana, kesho itakuwa na mvua kubwa.

135
00:08:37,018 --> 00:08:39,885
Walisema pia kuna upepo mkali.

136
00:08:39,908 --> 00:08:44,113
Mvua kubwa? Si nzuri.

137
00:08:44,136 --> 00:08:48,603
Nilikuwa na mpango wa kucheza tennis nje kesho.

138
00:08:48,626 --> 00:08:50,798
Tennis?

139
00:08:50,821 --> 00:08:55,355
Kesho usicheze tennis nje.

140
00:08:55,378 --> 00:08:57,395
Ni hatari.

141
00:08:57,418 --> 00:08:59,152
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

142
00:08:59,175 --> 00:09:03,264
Basi, tutaahiri tennis ya kesho.

143
00:09:03,288 --> 00:09:05,454
Ni jambo la kusikitisha.

144
00:09:05,477 --> 00:09:08,050
Ni bora hivyo.

145
00:09:08,073 --> 00:09:12,326
Walisema pia joto litapungua kesho.

146
00:09:12,350 --> 00:09:14,194
Itakuwa baridi.

147
00:09:14,218 --> 00:09:16,837
Itakuwa baridi?

148
00:09:16,860 --> 00:09:21,158
Basi, ni bora uvae koti nzito.

149
00:09:21,182 --> 00:09:25,348
Ndiyo, usipate mafua.

150
00:09:25,371 --> 00:09:28,738
Kesho hali ya hewa itakuwa mbaya.

151
00:09:28,761 --> 00:09:34,420
Je, una mpango wa kwenda mahali popote kesho, Tanaka-san?

152
00:09:34,444 --> 00:09:38,844
Hapana, sitakwenda popote.

153
00:09:38,867 --> 00:09:42,233
Nitaketi nyumbani na kusoma kitabu.

154
00:09:42,256 --> 00:09:44,456
Hiyo ni nzuri.

155
00:09:44,479 --> 00:09:50,013
Mimi pia nitaamua kukaa nyumbani na kupumzika kesho.

156
00:09:50,036 --> 00:09:53,902
Je, Suzuki-san, utakwenda kufanya nini nyumbani?

157
00:09:53,925 --> 00:09:57,823
Nitazifanyia mazoezi lugha ya Kijapani.

158
00:09:57,847 --> 00:10:03,267
Nina mtihani mwezi ujao, lazima nijitahidi.

159
00:10:03,290 --> 00:10:06,296
Una mtihani?

160
00:10:06,319 --> 00:10:08,594
Hii ni ngumu sana, kweli.

161
00:10:08,617 --> 00:10:11,150
Ni mtihani wa nini?

162
00:10:11,173 --> 00:10:13,773
Ni mtihani wa kanji.

163
00:10:13,796 --> 00:10:18,094
Kujifunza kanji ni vigumu sana.

164
00:10:18,117 --> 00:10:22,161
Inafaa uandike kanji kila siku.

165
00:10:22,185 --> 00:10:25,385
Mimi nilijifunza kila siku.

166
00:10:25,408 --> 00:10:29,903
Ndiyo, nafanya mazoezi kwa saa moja kila siku.

167
00:10:29,926 --> 00:10:33,609
Lakini nasahau haraka.

168
00:10:33,633 --> 00:10:36,633
Kila mtu huanza hivi.

169
00:10:36,656 --> 00:10:39,463
Usikate tamaa, endelea kujitahidi.

170
00:10:39,487 --> 00:10:41,744
Ndiyo, asante sana.

171
00:10:41,767 --> 00:10:44,984
Kesho nitajitahidi kwa siku nzima.

172
00:10:45,008 --> 00:10:48,008
Sehemu ya 5: Kuhifadhi na Ustadi wa Salon ya Urembo

173
00:10:48,008 --> 00:10:54,894
Suzuki, naomba kuuliza kitu, una muda sasa?

174
00:10:54,917 --> 00:10:58,084
Ndiyo, nini?

175
00:10:58,107 --> 00:11:03,154
Sasa niko huru, hakuna matatizo.

176
00:11:03,178 --> 00:11:08,311
Suzuki, unawahi kukata nywele wapi?

177
00:11:08,334 --> 00:11:13,668
Ninakata nywele salon karibu na kituo cha treni.

178
00:11:13,692 --> 00:11:17,625
Ni duka lenye bango la buluu.

179
00:11:17,648 --> 00:11:21,181
Aa, duka hilo?

180
00:11:21,204 --> 00:11:24,095
Wao ni wazuri?

181
00:11:24,119 --> 00:11:28,418
Ndiyo, wao ni hodari sana.

182
00:11:28,442 --> 00:11:32,058
Ustadi wao wa kukata ni wa ajabu.

183
00:11:32,082 --> 00:11:35,250
Wafanyakazi pia ni wakaribu.

184
00:11:35,273 --> 00:11:38,440
Unafanya booking vipi?

185
00:11:38,463 --> 00:11:40,296
Kwa simu?

186
00:11:40,319 --> 00:11:44,453
Unaweza kufanya booking kwa mtandao.

187
00:11:44,476 --> 00:11:47,342
Ni rahisi zaidi kuliko kupiga simu.

188
00:11:47,365 --> 00:11:49,377
Ndiyo hivyo.

189
00:11:49,401 --> 00:11:53,419
Mimi pia nataka kukata nywele wiki ijayo.

190
00:11:53,442 --> 00:11:57,209
Nywele zangu zimekuwa ndefu sana.

191
00:11:57,233 --> 00:12:00,766
Kweli, zimekuwa ndefu kidogo.

192
00:12:00,789 --> 00:12:05,556
Nafikiri nywele fupi zitakufaa zaidi.

193
00:12:05,579 --> 00:12:07,612
Asante sana.

194
00:12:07,635 --> 00:12:12,002
Duka hilo linagharimu pesa ngapi?

195
00:12:12,025 --> 00:12:15,802
Kukata kunagharimu kama elfu nne.

196
00:12:15,825 --> 00:12:19,510
Nafikiri ni rahisi kidogo kuliko duka zingine.

197
00:12:19,534 --> 00:12:23,767
Elfu nne? Hiyo ni bei nzuri.

198
00:12:23,790 --> 00:12:29,157
Si ghali, nitafanya booking kwanza kisha nitaenda.

199
00:12:29,180 --> 00:12:35,018
Jumamosi huwa na watu wengi, ni bora usiku wa wiki.

200
00:12:35,041 --> 00:12:37,844
Wanafanya kazi mpaka saa tatu usiku.

201
00:12:37,867 --> 00:12:42,364
Wanafanya kazi mpaka saa tatu usiku? Hiyo ni rahisi sana.

202
00:12:42,388 --> 00:12:45,521
Nitafanya booking baada ya kazi.

203
00:12:45,544 --> 00:12:48,744
Ndiyo, fanya hivyo.

204
00:12:48,767 --> 00:12:52,574
Hivyo utapata muda wa kutosha.

205
00:12:52,598 --> 00:12:57,577
Suzuki, unaenda lini tena?

206
00:12:57,600 --> 00:13:03,445
Mwishoni mwa mwezi nitapiga pama.

207
00:13:03,468 --> 00:13:06,435
Pama? Hiyo ni nzuri.

208
00:13:06,458 --> 00:13:09,791
Hakika utakuwa mzuri.

209
00:13:09,814 --> 00:13:11,948
Ndiyo, asante sana.

210
00:13:11,971 --> 00:13:14,771
Ninafurahi sana.

211
00:13:14,794 --> 00:13:17,794
Sehemu ya 6: Ununuzaji na Kamera Mpya

212
00:13:17,794 --> 00:13:23,560
Suzuki, jana ulienda ununuzaji popote?

213
00:13:23,583 --> 00:13:25,983
Nilikuona karibu na kituo cha treni.

214
00:13:26,006 --> 00:13:32,006
Ndiyo, jana nilienda dukani kubwa ya umeme huko Shibuya.

215
00:13:32,029 --> 00:13:34,429
Ulinunua nini?

216
00:13:34,452 --> 00:13:37,427
Kifaa kipya cha nyumbani?

217
00:13:37,451 --> 00:13:40,726
Nilinunua kamera mpya.

218
00:13:40,749 --> 00:13:42,983
Hii ndiyo.

219
00:13:43,006 --> 00:13:46,103
Ni bidhaa mpya iliyotolewa jana.

220
00:13:46,126 --> 00:13:50,203
Waa, kamera hii ni nzuri sana!

221
00:13:50,227 --> 00:13:52,460
Ilikuwa ghali, sivyo?

222
00:13:52,483 --> 00:13:55,970
Ndiyo, ilikuwa shilingi hamsini elfu.

223
00:13:55,994 --> 00:14:00,127
Kwa ajili yangu ilikuwa ghali kidogo.

224
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:02,487
Shilingi hamsini elfu?

225
00:14:02,511 --> 00:14:10,244
Lakini Suzuki, wewe ni mzuri sana katika kupiga picha, hivyo unahitaji kamera nzuri.

226
00:14:10,267 --> 00:14:14,308
Hapana, bado sijafanya vizuri.

227
00:14:14,332 --> 00:14:17,532
Nataka kufanya mazoezi zaidi.

228
00:14:17,555 --> 00:14:21,688
Una mpango wa kupiga aina gani za picha na kamera hii?

229
00:14:21,711 --> 00:14:28,244
Nataka kupiga picha za mandhari nzuri za Japani na vyakula vya kupendeza.

230
00:14:28,267 --> 00:14:29,801
Sawa, nzuri sana.

231
00:14:29,824 --> 00:14:34,990
Mara ijayo nipige picha za chakula nilichokitengeneza.

232
00:14:35,013 --> 00:14:38,747
Ndiyo, naomba nipige.

233
00:14:38,770 --> 00:14:43,053
Chakula chako Tanaka daima kinaonekana kitamu.

234
00:14:43,076 --> 00:14:45,276
Asante sana.

235
00:14:45,299 --> 00:14:47,387
Ninashukuru sana.

236
00:14:47,410 --> 00:14:50,977
Unaposema ninafanya vizuri, napata ujasiri.

237
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:54,495
Tanaka, una kamera?

238
00:14:54,518 --> 00:14:58,355
Hapana, sina kamera.

239
00:14:58,378 --> 00:15:01,995
Kila wakati napiga picha kwa kamera ya simu yangu.

240
00:15:02,018 --> 00:15:08,913
Simu za kisasa zinaweza kupiga picha nzuri, hivyo simu ni ya kutosha.

241
00:15:08,937 --> 00:15:15,903
Ndiyo, lakini baada ya kuona kamera yako mpya Suzuki, ninaona ninaomba pia.

242
00:15:15,926 --> 00:15:20,260
Basi, siku ijayo twende pamoja dukani ya umeme.

243
00:15:20,283 --> 00:15:23,249
Kuna aina nyingi za kamera.

244
00:15:23,272 --> 00:15:24,963
Sawa, nzuri sana.

245
00:15:24,987 --> 00:15:27,987
Kuwatazama tu kunafurahisha.

246
00:15:28,010 --> 00:15:34,210
Ndiyo, mwishoni mwa wiki kuna matamasha, hivyo kutakuwa na furaha zaidi.

247
00:15:34,233 --> 00:15:36,566
Ndiyo, twende.

248
00:15:36,589 --> 00:15:39,589
Sehemu ya 7: Kazi za Ziada na Mipango ya Kupumzika / Kuweka Mzigo wa Ziada na Kupanga Pumziko

249
00:15:39,589 --> 00:15:43,795
Suzuki, umekuwa mzigo hivi karibuni?

250
00:15:43,819 --> 00:15:47,586
Uso wako unaonekana uchovu kidogo.

251
00:15:47,609 --> 00:15:54,375
Ndiyo, wiki hii kazi nyingi sana, ni ngumu kidogo.

252
00:15:54,398 --> 00:15:58,432
Kila siku unafanya kazi mpaka saa ngapi?

253
00:15:58,455 --> 00:16:02,899
Kila siku ninafanya kazi mpaka saa mbili usiku.

254
00:16:02,922 --> 00:16:05,855
Jana pia nilifanya kazi mpaka saa mbili.

255
00:16:05,878 --> 00:16:08,932
Hii inakuchosha.

256
00:16:08,955 --> 00:16:15,632
Kufanya kazi za ziada kila siku si vizuri, usijipange mno.

257
00:16:15,656 --> 00:16:17,456
Asante sana.

258
00:16:17,479 --> 00:16:23,212
Lakini, kuanzia wiki ijayo mradi utamalizika na nitakuwa na muda wa ziada.

259
00:16:23,235 --> 00:16:26,469
Ni vizuri kusikia hivyo.

260
00:16:26,492 --> 00:16:30,225
Utakapokuwa na muda wa ziada, utataka kufanya nini?

261
00:16:30,248 --> 00:16:34,067
Nina mpango wa kwenda pwani na marafiki.

262
00:16:34,091 --> 00:16:39,372
Nataka kuogelea baharini na kula samaki tamu.

263
00:16:39,396 --> 00:16:42,642
Pwani? Ni nzuri sana!

264
00:16:42,665 --> 00:16:45,914
Unaenda pwani gani?

265
00:16:45,938 --> 00:16:49,904
Nitakwenda pwani ya Kanagawa.

266
00:16:49,927 --> 00:16:54,201
Kutoka Tokyo, unaweza kwenda kwa treni kwa saa moja tu.

267
00:16:54,225 --> 00:16:58,032
Saa moja? Ni karibu sana!

268
00:16:58,056 --> 00:17:01,262
Ninapenda bahari sana pia.

269
00:17:01,286 --> 00:17:04,154
Kwa sababu pwani ni safi sana.

270
00:17:04,177 --> 00:17:07,449
Tanaka, je, huwezi kuja pamoja nasi?

271
00:17:07,472 --> 00:17:10,513
Marafiki wako watashangilia sana.

272
00:17:10,537 --> 00:17:12,829
Ni sawa hata?

273
00:17:12,853 --> 00:17:15,786
Ningependa sana kuja pamoja.

274
00:17:15,809 --> 00:17:18,548
Bahari ni ya furaha sana.

275
00:17:18,572 --> 00:17:23,669
Basi, tutaenda siku ya Jumamosi ijayo.

276
00:17:23,693 --> 00:17:28,329
Kwa gari ni rahisi zaidi, nitakodisha gari.

277
00:17:28,353 --> 00:17:30,319
Sawa.

278
00:17:30,342 --> 00:17:34,675
Pesa za gari nitakodisha nitazipata mimi.

279
00:17:34,698 --> 00:17:38,133
Hapana, tuigawane.

280
00:17:38,157 --> 00:17:41,566
Hiyo ni haki zaidi.

281
00:17:41,590 --> 00:17:43,590
Ndiyo hivyo.

282
00:17:43,613 --> 00:17:48,792
Basi, chakula cha asubuhi siku hiyo nitakichakula na kukileta.

283
00:17:48,815 --> 00:17:51,581
Ni chakula cha mfuko.

284
00:17:51,604 --> 00:17:54,302
Waa, asante sana.

285
00:17:54,326 --> 00:17:59,774
Chakula cha Tanaka kilichotayarishwa kwa mikono ni kitamu sana, ninafurahi sana.

286
00:17:59,797 --> 00:18:02,830
Ndiyo, usijali.

287
00:18:02,853 --> 00:18:04,987
Nitakifanya kwa wingi.

288
00:18:05,010 --> 00:18:08,543
Ndiyo, hakika itakuwa na jua.

289
00:18:08,566 --> 00:18:11,566
Mstari wa 8: Maandalizi ya Chakula na Ununuzi / Maandalizi ya Chakula na Ununuzi

290
00:18:11,566 --> 00:18:17,499
Fuzuki, je, umekwisha tayari maandalizi ya karamu ya kesho?

291
00:18:17,522 --> 00:18:21,166
Hapana, sijamaliza bado.

292
00:18:21,190 --> 00:18:25,797
Kwa sababu mizigo ni mingi, sasa nitakwenda kununua vitu.

293
00:18:25,820 --> 00:18:28,153
Unanunua nini?

294
00:18:28,176 --> 00:18:29,980
Kwenye supamaketi?

295
00:18:30,004 --> 00:18:34,206
Ninataka kununua vinywaji na vitamu vingi.

296
00:18:34,230 --> 00:18:36,663
Kwa sababu tunahitaji vingi.

297
00:18:36,686 --> 00:18:42,023
Kwa sababu mizigo itakuwa nzito, nitakuja pamoja nawe.

298
00:18:42,046 --> 00:18:44,114
Nitakupigia gari.

299
00:18:44,137 --> 00:18:45,775
Asante sana.

300
00:18:45,799 --> 00:18:47,698
Unaokoa.

301
00:18:47,721 --> 00:18:50,521
Peke yangu ingekuwa vigumu sana.

302
00:18:50,544 --> 00:18:53,950
Watakuja watu wangapi kwenye karamu?

303
00:18:53,973 --> 00:18:57,573
Watafika watu ishirini hivi kwa jumla.

304
00:18:57,596 --> 00:19:00,263
Itakuwa na sherehe sana.

305
00:19:00,286 --> 00:19:05,086
Watu ishirini? Karamu kubwa itakuwa!

306
00:19:05,109 --> 00:19:07,312
Chumba kiko wapi?

307
00:19:07,335 --> 00:19:10,618
Ni chumba cha kukodisha karibu na ofisi.

308
00:19:10,642 --> 00:19:13,609
Pale ni pana na safi sana.

309
00:19:13,632 --> 00:19:16,001
Aa, pale?

310
00:19:16,025 --> 00:19:20,858
Hakika ni jengo jipya, ni mahali pazuri.

311
00:19:20,881 --> 00:19:26,448
Ndiyo, lakini lazima tutulete takataka zetu zote nyumbani.

312
00:19:26,471 --> 00:19:28,604
Hiyo ni kali sana.

313
00:19:28,627 --> 00:19:32,960
Ni kweli, hiyo ni vigumu kidogo.

314
00:19:32,983 --> 00:19:36,950
Tunahitaji mifuko mikubwa ya takataka.

315
00:19:36,973 --> 00:19:42,706
Ndiyo, nitanunua leo hiyo kwenye supamaketi karibu na duka la umeme.

316
00:19:42,729 --> 00:19:46,008
Karamu itaanza saa ngapi?

317
00:19:46,032 --> 00:19:48,904
Itaanza saa moja usiku.

318
00:19:48,927 --> 00:19:50,861
Hadi saa tatu.

319
00:19:50,884 --> 00:19:52,617
Masaa mawili.

320
00:19:52,640 --> 00:19:55,044
Sawa.

321
00:19:55,067 --> 00:19:59,701
Suzuki, kesho utakuwa kwenye ukumbi saa ngapi?

322
00:19:59,724 --> 00:20:03,900
Niko tayari kwa sababu nitakuwa na maandalizi, nitakuja saa kumi na moja.

323
00:20:03,923 --> 00:20:08,381
Basi mimi pia nitakuja saa kumi na moja na kukusaidia katika maandalizi.

324
00:20:08,404 --> 00:20:10,337
Asante sana.

325
00:20:10,360 --> 00:20:13,894
Bwana Tanaka, wewe ni mtu mzuri sana.

326
00:20:13,916 --> 00:20:16,207
Daimu unanisaidia.

327
00:20:16,231 --> 00:20:21,877
Hapana, ni kwa sababu napenda sana sherehe, nataka tu kufurahia.

328
00:20:21,901 --> 00:20:24,572
Haha, ndivyo.

329
00:20:24,595 --> 00:20:28,676
Basi tutafanye sherehe nzuri pamoja.

330
00:20:28,700 --> 00:20:31,700
Sehemu ya 9: Vidokezo vya Kuimarisha Ujapani / Tips za Kuboresha Ujapani

331
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:36,597
Bwana Suzuki, maisha nchini Japani yamekuwaje?

332
00:20:36,620 --> 00:20:42,105
Tayari imekuwa mwaka mmoja, nimeshazoea sana.

333
00:20:42,128 --> 00:20:45,395
Maisha yana faida nyingi.

334
00:20:45,418 --> 00:20:49,651
Umekuwa mzuri sana katika Kijapani.

335
00:20:49,674 --> 00:20:52,282
Matamshi yako ni mazuri.

336
00:20:52,305 --> 00:20:56,105
Hapana, bado nina matatizo.

337
00:20:56,128 --> 00:21:00,162
Sijui kabisa Kijapani cha habari.

338
00:21:00,185 --> 00:21:05,751
Kijapani cha habari kina maneno magumu mengi.

339
00:21:05,774 --> 00:21:10,646
Ni vyema kutazama televisheni kila siku.

340
00:21:10,670 --> 00:21:13,303
Ndio, ninatazama kila siku.

341
00:21:13,326 --> 00:21:19,060
Lakini, spidi ya wasemaji wa habari ni haraka mno.

342
00:21:19,083 --> 00:21:20,816
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

343
00:21:20,839 --> 00:21:26,972
Basi, kwa mwanzo unaweza kutazama katuni rahisi za watoto.

344
00:21:26,995 --> 00:21:29,806
Katuni za watoto?

345
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:32,722
Hiyo ni wazo zuri.

346
00:21:32,745 --> 00:21:35,618
Maneno ni rahisi.

347
00:21:35,642 --> 00:21:44,479
Ndio, watoto wa Japani wote wanakumbuka maneno kwa kutazama katuni, ni njia yenye matokeo.

348
00:21:44,502 --> 00:21:45,937
Sawa.

349
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:49,327
Kutoka leo nitazaanza kutazama mara moja.

350
00:21:49,350 --> 00:21:54,317
Katika maisha ya Japani, nini ni kigumu zaidi?

351
00:21:54,341 --> 00:21:56,560
Bei ya vitu?

352
00:21:56,583 --> 00:22:02,230
Hapana, kusonga kwa treni kila asubuhi ni shida.

353
00:22:02,254 --> 00:22:06,587
Treni yenye watu wengi asubuhi ni shida sana.

354
00:22:06,610 --> 00:22:10,864
Aa, treni yenye watu wengi.

355
00:22:10,888 --> 00:22:15,534
Watu wa Japani wote wanachukia hilo.

356
00:22:15,558 --> 00:22:18,158
Ni nyembamba na haina raha.

357
00:22:18,181 --> 00:22:23,275
Bwana Tanaka, je, wewe pia unasafiri kwa treni yenye watu wengi kila asubuhi?

358
00:22:23,299 --> 00:22:30,499
Hapana, sikupendi treni, kwa hivyo huenda kazini kwa baiskeli kila siku.

359
00:22:30,523 --> 00:22:32,726
Hiyo ni afya.

360
00:22:32,749 --> 00:22:34,986
Baiskeli?

361
00:22:35,010 --> 00:22:37,987
Siku za mvua unafanya nini?

362
00:22:38,011 --> 00:22:39,944
Litakuwa ngumu, sivyo?

363
00:22:39,967 --> 00:22:43,367
Siku za mvua huenda kwa basi.

364
00:22:43,390 --> 00:22:48,447
Basi ni tupu zaidi kuliko treni, hivyo ni kimya.

365
00:22:48,470 --> 00:22:50,237
Ndiyo hivyo.

366
00:22:50,260 --> 00:22:54,098
Kupungua kwa mfadhaiko wa treni ni vizuri.

367
00:22:54,122 --> 00:22:58,170
Kutoka kesho nitaanza kwenda kwa basi.

368
00:22:58,193 --> 00:23:01,659
Ndio, jaribu mara moja.

369
00:23:01,682 --> 00:23:05,492
Ninafikiri ni rahisi zaidi kuliko treni.

370
00:23:05,516 --> 00:23:07,449
Sawa.

371
00:23:07,472 --> 00:23:11,210
Asante kwa kunifundisha mambo mengi.

372
00:23:11,234 --> 00:23:14,234
Sehemu ya 10: Ugunduzi wa Mgahawa Mpya / Kugundua Mgahawa Mpya

373
00:23:14,234 --> 00:23:20,100
Bwana Suzuki, jana ulikuwa kwenye mgahawa mpya karibu na kituo?

374
00:23:20,123 --> 00:23:22,923
Ndio, nilikuwepo.

375
00:23:22,946 --> 00:23:26,029
Nilikuwa ninakunywa kahawa saa tisa mchana.

376
00:23:26,052 --> 00:23:28,419
Ulinikuta vizuri sana.

377
00:23:28,442 --> 00:23:31,413
Kama nilivyokuwa nakisia, ndiye Suzuki.

378
00:23:31,436 --> 00:23:34,207
Ningepaswa kukusalimia.

379
00:23:34,231 --> 00:23:37,831
Eeh, Tanaka, ulikuwa katika kafe ile pia?

380
00:23:37,854 --> 00:23:42,220
Hapana, nilipitia kwa gari.

381
00:23:42,243 --> 00:23:46,010
Nikaona Suzuki karibu na dirisha.

382
00:23:46,033 --> 00:23:48,400
Aa, ndivyo ilivyokuwa.

383
00:23:48,423 --> 00:23:53,681
Kafe ile ni tulivu, kwa hivyo naenda huko mara kwa mara nikisoma.

384
00:23:53,704 --> 00:23:56,974
Je, kahawa katika kafe ile ni nzuri?

385
00:23:56,997 --> 00:24:00,531
Ndiyo, ni tamu sana.

386
00:24:00,554 --> 00:24:03,087
Harufu yake ni nzuri mno.

387
00:24:03,110 --> 00:24:06,317
Kuna aina nyingi za chai pia.

388
00:24:06,341 --> 00:24:07,987
Sawa, nzuri sana.

389
00:24:08,010 --> 00:24:12,882
Ni duka la kisasa, naomba niende siku hizi.

390
00:24:12,906 --> 00:24:17,239
Je, leo baada ya kazi twende pamoja?

391
00:24:17,262 --> 00:24:19,146
Leo?

392
00:24:19,169 --> 00:24:26,336
Leo nitaishia kazi saa kumi na moja, naweza kwenda. Mimi pia nitaishia saa kumi na moja.

393
00:24:26,359 --> 00:24:30,092
Kazi ya wiki hii haikuwa nzito sana, kwa hivyo...

394
00:24:30,115 --> 00:24:32,574
Basi, twende pamoja.

395
00:24:32,598 --> 00:24:36,271
Je, kuna keki tamu katika kafe ile?

396
00:24:36,294 --> 00:24:40,861
Ndiyo, kuna keki ya chokoleti na keki ya rulo.

397
00:24:40,884 --> 00:24:43,550
Ni tamu sana na nzuri.

398
00:24:43,573 --> 00:24:47,973
Eeh, napenda sana keki ya chokoleti!

399
00:24:47,996 --> 00:24:50,689
Napenda sana vyakula vyenye sukari.

400
00:24:50,712 --> 00:24:55,567
Keki ya chokoleti huko ni maarufu zaidi.

401
00:24:55,591 --> 00:24:58,958
Ni maarufu sana, kwa hivyo inauzika haraka.

402
00:24:58,981 --> 00:25:00,395
Ndiyo hivyo.

403
00:25:00,418 --> 00:25:04,673
Sipendi kukosa, basi haraka twende.

404
00:25:04,697 --> 00:25:10,133
Tutafika dukani saa kumi na mbili na nusu, hakuna tatizo.

405
00:25:10,156 --> 00:25:11,994
Ninafurahi sana!

406
00:25:12,017 --> 00:25:15,952
Leo nitamaliza kazi mapema.

407
00:25:15,976 --> 00:25:19,066
Ndiyo, mimi pia nitafanya bidii.

408
00:25:19,090 --> 00:25:22,090
Mpango wa Ununuzi

409
00:25:22,090 --> 00:25:27,904
Hali ya hewa ni nzuri, je, twende mahali fulani?

410
00:25:27,928 --> 00:25:31,405
Ninahitaji begi mpya.

411
00:25:31,429 --> 00:25:33,995
Tutakwenda wapi kununua?

412
00:25:34,018 --> 00:25:38,088
Tutakwenda madukani mbele ya kituo cha gari moshi.

413
00:25:38,112 --> 00:25:41,112
Unataka begi la aina gani?

414
00:25:41,135 --> 00:25:45,611
Ninahitaji begi kubwa.

415
00:25:45,635 --> 00:25:49,612
Utaweka nini katika begi jipya?

416
00:25:49,635 --> 00:25:54,002
Nitaweka kamusi na vitabu vingi.

417
00:25:54,025 --> 00:25:56,392
Mizigo yako ni nzito!

418
00:25:56,415 --> 00:26:02,948
Kwa hivyo, ninahitaji begi imara. Unataka rangi gani?

419
00:26:02,971 --> 00:26:07,045
Ninapenda rangi nyeusi.

420
00:26:07,068 --> 00:26:10,468
Begi nyeusi ni ya kisasa sana.

421
00:26:10,491 --> 00:26:14,558
Nitabeba kila siku kwenda shuleni.

422
00:26:14,581 --> 00:26:18,548
Kwenye duka hilo kuna duka la viatu pia.

423
00:26:18,571 --> 00:26:21,908
Ninahitaji viatu pia.

424
00:26:21,932 --> 00:26:24,581
Unataka viatu vya aina gani?

425
00:26:24,605 --> 00:26:28,689
Ninahitaji viatu vyenye uzito mdogo.

426
00:26:28,712 --> 00:26:31,330
Vitatakuwa vizuri wakati wa kutembea.

427
00:26:31,354 --> 00:26:35,321
Nataka kutembea sana kila siku.

428
00:26:35,344 --> 00:26:40,782
Basi, leo twende dukani kuangalia viatu pia.

429
00:26:40,805 --> 00:26:44,649
Ununuzi wa leo ni furaha kubwa kwangu.

430
00:26:44,673 --> 00:26:49,406
Ninataka kununua vitamu vizuri katika duka la rejareja.

431
00:26:49,429 --> 00:26:52,908
Baada ya ununuzi, tutakula pamoja.

432
00:26:52,931 --> 00:26:55,665
Twende kwenye kituo cha treni haraka.

433
00:26:55,688 --> 00:26:58,688
Mstari wa 12: Maandalizi ya Chakula cha Pamoja na Kusafisha / Maandalizi ya Chakula cha Pamoja na Kusafisha

434
00:26:58,688 --> 00:27:02,578
Tunajiandaa kwa chakula cha kesho.

435
00:27:02,601 --> 00:27:06,606
Sasa ninasafisha chumba.

436
00:27:06,630 --> 00:27:08,278
Asante sana.

437
00:27:08,301 --> 00:27:11,434
Umeshafanya usafi!

438
00:27:11,457 --> 00:27:14,691
Tutasimama na kufanya nini sasa?

439
00:27:14,714 --> 00:27:18,853
Weka vyakula juu ya meza.

440
00:27:18,876 --> 00:27:21,757
Naweza kuweka hapa?

441
00:27:21,781 --> 00:27:23,423
Tafadhali.

442
00:27:23,446 --> 00:27:26,823
Vinywaji viko wapi?

443
00:27:26,847 --> 00:27:29,780
Viko ndani ya friji.

444
00:27:29,803 --> 00:27:32,644
Nani atakayekuja chakulani?

445
00:27:32,667 --> 00:27:36,671
Marafiki kumi kutoka darasa watakuja.

446
00:27:36,695 --> 00:27:39,183
Itakuwa na sherehe kubwa!

447
00:27:39,206 --> 00:27:42,944
Kwa hiyo, fungua dirisha.

448
00:27:42,968 --> 00:27:45,866
Naweza kuweka muziki?

449
00:27:45,890 --> 00:27:49,657
Tujifanyie maandalizi wakati wa kusikiliza muziki.

450
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:53,913
Nina CD mpya.

451
00:27:53,936 --> 00:27:56,582
Weka hiyo.

452
00:27:56,606 --> 00:27:59,101
Kiti hazitoshi, sivyo?

453
00:27:59,125 --> 00:28:02,691
Niletee kutoka chumbani jirani?

454
00:28:02,714 --> 00:28:05,133
Niletee tano.

455
00:28:05,157 --> 00:28:09,690
Tunapika chakula nyingi, basi nisaidie.

456
00:28:09,713 --> 00:28:13,580
Mimi ninaleta sasa hivi.

457
00:28:13,603 --> 00:28:16,214
Weka sahani pia.

458
00:28:16,237 --> 00:28:18,604
Ziko wapi?

459
00:28:18,627 --> 00:28:22,194
Ziko ndani ya kabati, toa nje.

460
00:28:22,217 --> 00:28:24,819
Ninazitoa sasa.

461
00:28:24,842 --> 00:28:27,780
Fua glasi pia.

462
00:28:27,803 --> 00:28:31,022
Glasi tayari zimefukuzwa.

463
00:28:31,046 --> 00:28:33,459
Asante sana.

464
00:28:33,482 --> 00:28:36,482
Mstari wa 13: Kazi ya Muda na Mazoezi ya Kijapani / Kazi ya Muda na Mazoezi ya Kijapani

465
00:28:36,482 --> 00:28:40,215
Kazi mpya ya muda inakuwaje?

466
00:28:40,238 --> 00:28:44,238
Kila siku ni furaha sana.

467
00:28:44,261 --> 00:28:47,355
Unafanya kazi gani?

468
00:28:47,379 --> 00:28:51,512
Ninaleta vyakula katika mgahawa.

469
00:28:51,535 --> 00:28:55,205
Unaenda saa ngapi kila siku?

470
00:28:55,228 --> 00:28:59,028
Naenda saa nne asubuhi.

471
00:28:59,051 --> 00:29:05,289
Nakwenda dukani, naosha mikono kwanza, kisha navaa nguo.

472
00:29:05,312 --> 00:29:07,797
Je, sheria ni ngumu?

473
00:29:07,821 --> 00:29:12,621
Hawatakiwi kutumia simu wakati wa kazi.

474
00:29:12,644 --> 00:29:15,500
Unasimama muda wote?

475
00:29:15,524 --> 00:29:19,990
Hawatakiwi kukaa mbele ya wateja.

476
00:29:20,013 --> 00:29:22,346
Ni kazi ngumu.

477
00:29:22,369 --> 00:29:28,736
Lakini ninasema Kijapani kila siku, kwa hiyo ninakuwa mzuri.

478
00:29:28,759 --> 00:29:31,292
Ni tabia nzuri.

479
00:29:31,315 --> 00:29:36,715
Ninafanya kazi hapa kwa saa tatu kila siku.

480
00:29:36,738 --> 00:29:40,548
Je, unafanya kazi ya kupika pia?

481
00:29:40,572 --> 00:29:44,623
Usihamishi chakula.

482
00:29:44,647 --> 00:29:46,826
Kwamba ni kubeba tu?

483
00:29:46,850 --> 00:29:51,519
Baada ya kubeba chakula, nitaosha sahani.

484
00:29:51,542 --> 00:29:53,879
Una shughuli nyingi?

485
00:29:53,903 --> 00:29:58,436
Mchana huwa na shughuli nyingi sana.

486
00:29:58,459 --> 00:30:01,626
Unanawa nguo zako mwenyewe?

487
00:30:01,649 --> 00:30:04,482
Nawanyesha katika kampuni.

488
00:30:04,505 --> 00:30:06,838
Duka zuri sana hili!

489
00:30:06,861 --> 00:30:12,234
Nimefanya kazi katika duka hili kwa muda mrefu.

490
00:30:12,258 --> 00:30:15,258
Sehemu ya 14: Maelezo ya Ratiba ya Safari

491
00:30:15,258 --> 00:30:18,991
Nitakueleza ratiba ya safari.

492
00:30:19,014 --> 00:30:20,581
Tafadhali.

493
00:30:20,604 --> 00:30:25,379
Tutatoa hoteli saa mbili asubuhi na tutatembea mpaka stesheni.

494
00:30:25,402 --> 00:30:29,075
Baada ya kufika stesheni, tutafanya nini?

495
00:30:29,099 --> 00:30:34,366
Baada ya kufika stesheni, tutanunua tiketi na kupanda treni.

496
00:30:34,390 --> 00:30:38,157
Utakula chakula kwenye treni?

497
00:30:38,180 --> 00:30:42,113
Tutakula chakula baada ya kufika hekaluni.

498
00:30:42,136 --> 00:30:44,303
Hekalu la aina gani?

499
00:30:44,326 --> 00:30:49,263
Hekalu lile lina bustani kubwa na ni nzuri sana.

500
00:30:49,287 --> 00:30:51,495
Ninafurahi sana!

501
00:30:51,518 --> 00:30:57,012
Jengo maarufu lina lango kubwa na ni zuri sana.

502
00:30:57,035 --> 00:30:59,835
Nataka kuchukua picha nyingi.

503
00:30:59,858 --> 00:31:04,058
Baada ya kutazama hekalu, tutaenda pwani karibu.

504
00:31:04,081 --> 00:31:07,419
Baada ya kufika pwani, tutafanya nini?

505
00:31:07,443 --> 00:31:13,114
Tutatembea pwani, kisha tutakula samaki tamu.

506
00:31:13,138 --> 00:31:17,350
Mji ule una samaki safi na tamu sana!

507
00:31:17,373 --> 00:31:22,339
Baada ya kula samaki, tutanunua zawadi.

508
00:31:22,362 --> 00:31:27,211
Baada ya kununua zawadi, tutarudi hoteli?

509
00:31:27,235 --> 00:31:30,689
Tutarudi hoteli saa moja usiku.

510
00:31:30,713 --> 00:31:33,403
Ratiba yenye shughuli nyingi sana!

511
00:31:33,426 --> 00:31:38,992
Lakini, mji ule una mandhari nzuri na ni furaha.

512
00:31:39,015 --> 00:31:42,470
Kesho nitachukua picha nyingi.

513
00:31:42,494 --> 00:31:47,832
Leo tutalala mapema ili kesho tutembee sana.

514
00:31:47,855 --> 00:31:50,422
Leo nitalala mapema.

515
00:31:50,445 --> 00:31:53,445
Sehemu ya 15: Jinsi ya Kutibu Ugonjwa

516
00:31:53,445 --> 00:31:55,902
Umepata nini?

517
00:31:55,926 --> 00:32:00,726
Kichwa changu kinauma kidogo na nina homa.

518
00:32:00,749 --> 00:32:04,041
Mwili wangu una uzito na ni mgumu.

519
00:32:04,064 --> 00:32:06,630
Unaumwa sana.

520
00:32:06,653 --> 00:32:09,269
Umekwenda hospitali?

521
00:32:09,293 --> 00:32:11,940
Bado sijawaendea.

522
00:32:11,963 --> 00:32:15,702
Kuna hospitali nzuri karibu.

523
00:32:15,726 --> 00:32:19,341
Wakunga wao ni wema?

524
00:32:19,365 --> 00:32:22,098
Tafadhali nenda hospitali.

525
00:32:22,121 --> 00:32:24,008
Sawa.

526
00:32:24,032 --> 00:32:27,720
Leo usiingie bafuni.

527
00:32:27,743 --> 00:32:30,877
Usoga hata kwa shuweri.

528
00:32:30,900 --> 00:32:34,678
Leo lazima ulale mapema.

529
00:32:34,701 --> 00:32:37,556
Nitakula nini leo?

530
00:32:37,580 --> 00:32:40,716
Nitapika udon laini.

531
00:32:40,739 --> 00:32:42,506
Tafadhali.

532
00:32:42,529 --> 00:32:47,103
Sasa lazima niende dukani.

533
00:32:47,126 --> 00:32:50,816
Basi, nitangoja chumbani.

534
00:32:50,839 --> 00:32:53,909
Kunywa dawa kisha ulale.

535
00:32:53,932 --> 00:32:55,511
Asante sana.

536
00:32:55,535 --> 00:32:59,668
Je, lazima nimpelekee kazi yangu ya nyumbani leo?

537
00:32:59,691 --> 00:33:02,658
Leo hautakiwi kupeleka.

538
00:33:02,681 --> 00:33:06,490
Lazima uiletee shuleni kesho.

539
00:33:06,514 --> 00:33:08,847
Sawa.

540
00:33:08,870 --> 00:33:13,003
Funga ufunguo na usimwache mtu yeyote ndani, tafadhali.

541
00:33:13,026 --> 00:33:14,467
Nitafunga.

542
00:33:14,491 --> 00:33:17,491
Sehemu ya 16: Jinsi ya Kupita Siku ya Pumziko / Jinsi ya Kupita Siku ya Mapumziko

543
00:33:17,491 --> 00:33:20,785
Kesho ni siku ya mapumziko, sivyo?

544
00:33:20,809 --> 00:33:24,409
Kesho hutaenda kazini.

545
00:33:24,432 --> 00:33:26,832
Nafurahi sana!

546
00:33:26,855 --> 00:33:31,222
Kwa hiyo, nitakuwa nimeamka hadi usiku wa manane leo.

547
00:33:31,245 --> 00:33:34,245
Kesho utafanya nini?

548
00:33:34,268 --> 00:33:37,868
Nitakwenda kupiga picha.

549
00:33:37,891 --> 00:33:40,224
Kupiga picha?

550
00:33:40,247 --> 00:33:45,936
Nipendeleo yangu ni kupiga picha za majengo ya kale.

551
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:48,160
Ni nzuri sana!

552
00:33:48,183 --> 00:33:51,316
Unapendelea nini wewe?

553
00:33:51,339 --> 00:33:56,037
Napenda kuogelea.

554
00:33:56,061 --> 00:33:58,095
Unaenda bweni la kuogelea?

555
00:33:58,118 --> 00:34:01,085
Naogelea kwa masaa mawili kila siku.

556
00:34:01,108 --> 00:34:03,351
Hii ni nzuri sana!

557
00:34:03,374 --> 00:34:07,553
Mimi sikupendi kuogelea kabisa.

558
00:34:07,577 --> 00:34:11,667
Ni ya furaha, nitakufundisha wakati mwingine.

559
00:34:11,690 --> 00:34:13,357
Tafadhali.

560
00:34:13,380 --> 00:34:17,834
Kabla ya kufanya mazoezi ya mwili, kwa kawaida unafanya nini?

561
00:34:17,858 --> 00:34:22,824
Kabla ya kukimbia, ninakunywa maji mengi.

562
00:34:22,847 --> 00:34:25,114
Ni muhimu sana.

563
00:34:25,137 --> 00:34:31,871
Kabla ya kuogelea, kwa kawaida naweza kufanya kidogo cha densi.

564
00:34:31,894 --> 00:34:33,863
Densi?

565
00:34:33,886 --> 00:34:36,257
Ni ya kufurahisha!

566
00:34:36,281 --> 00:34:40,556
Inafanya mwili kupata joto, hivyo ni nzuri.

567
00:34:40,579 --> 00:34:44,779
Kabla ya kutoka, nitakagua kamera yangu.

568
00:34:44,802 --> 00:34:50,136
Kesho hautakiwi kuamka mapema, kwa hiyo lala kwa muda mrefu.

569
00:34:50,159 --> 00:34:52,230
Nitakula hivyo.

570
00:34:52,253 --> 00:34:55,253
Sehemu ya 17: Kumbukumbu na Mipango ya Safari ya Japani / Kumbukumbu na Mipango ya Safari ya Japani

571
00:34:55,253 --> 00:34:59,871
Umewahi kwenda Japani?

572
00:34:59,895 --> 00:35:04,428
Nilienda mara moja mwakani mwishoni.

573
00:35:04,451 --> 00:35:06,622
Ulienda wapi?

574
00:35:06,645 --> 00:35:09,478
Nilienda Hokkaido.

575
00:35:09,501 --> 00:35:12,997
Uliwahi kufanya nini huko Hokkaido?

576
00:35:13,021 --> 00:35:17,988
Nilifanya skii na kula samaki tamu.

577
00:35:18,011 --> 00:35:21,228
Una uzoefu wa skii?

578
00:35:21,252 --> 00:35:26,452
Nina uzoefu wa skii tangu nilipokuwa mtoto.

579
00:35:26,475 --> 00:35:30,075
Sijawahi kufanya skii.

580
00:35:30,098 --> 00:35:35,437
Si ngumu, basi twende pamoja wakati mwingine.

581
00:35:35,460 --> 00:35:38,993
Mwaka huu wa joto utakwenda tena Japani?

582
00:35:39,016 --> 00:35:43,216
Mwaka huu wa joto nataka kwenda Tokyo.

583
00:35:43,239 --> 00:35:45,873
Utafanya nini Tokyo?

584
00:35:45,895 --> 00:35:50,784
Nataka kutazama mahekalu ya kale na kufanya ununuzi.

585
00:35:50,808 --> 00:35:54,616
Umewahi kwenda hekalu la Asakusa?

586
00:35:54,639 --> 00:35:57,173
Bado sijawahi.

587
00:35:57,196 --> 00:36:02,277
Nilienda Asakusa miaka mitatu iliyopita.

588
00:36:02,300 --> 00:36:05,067
Je, pale ni mahali penye shughuli nyingi?

589
00:36:05,090 --> 00:36:09,857
Nilipiga picha na kununua zawadi.

590
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:12,482
Ni ya kufurahisha!

591
00:36:12,505 --> 00:36:18,871
Kwenye Tokyo, kula vyakula vizuri na kuona mandhari nzuri.

592
00:36:18,894 --> 00:36:21,928
Nataka kusafiri sana.

593
00:36:21,951 --> 00:36:24,951
Mstari wa 18: Maendeleo katika Kujifunza Kijapani

594
00:36:24,951 --> 00:36:30,151
Umejifunza Kijapani kwa muda mrefu, sivyo?

595
00:36:30,174 --> 00:36:33,707
Nimejifunza kwa miaka miwili tayari.

596
00:36:33,730 --> 00:36:38,063
Umekuwa mzuri sana katika mazungumzo!

597
00:36:38,086 --> 00:36:39,962
Asante sana.

598
00:36:39,986 --> 00:36:44,440
Lakini, kanji bado ni ngumu.

599
00:36:44,464 --> 00:36:48,443
Unajifunza kwa muda gani kila siku?

600
00:36:48,466 --> 00:36:53,033
Najifunza saa moja kila siku.

601
00:36:53,056 --> 00:36:55,623
Hii ni nzuri sana!

602
00:36:55,646 --> 00:37:00,730
Mwaka ujao, ninafikiri itakuwa ngumu zaidi.

603
00:37:00,753 --> 00:37:04,720
Lakini, nina uhakika utashinda.

604
00:37:04,743 --> 00:37:07,876
Nitapigania kila siku.

605
00:37:07,899 --> 00:37:12,032
Je, unataka kufanya kazi nchini Japani siku za usoni?

606
00:37:12,055 --> 00:37:16,589
Ninapenda kufanya kazi katika kampuni ya Japani.

607
00:37:16,612 --> 00:37:19,545
Unataka kufanya kazi gani?

608
00:37:19,568 --> 00:37:23,419
Nataka kufanya kazi ya kompyuta.

609
00:37:23,442 --> 00:37:27,331
Maisha nchini Japani yanafaa kuwa ya furaha, ninaamini.

610
00:37:27,354 --> 00:37:31,721
Nina wasiwasi kidogo kwa sababu bei ya vitu ni ghali.

611
00:37:31,744 --> 00:37:37,677
Tokyo ni ghali, lakini miji mingine ni rahisi zaidi.

612
00:37:37,700 --> 00:37:40,756
Nimefurahi kusikia hayo.

613
00:37:40,780 --> 00:37:45,651
Ninaamini Kijapani chako kitaendelea kuwa bora zaidi.

614
00:37:45,674 --> 00:37:47,318
Asante sana.

615
00:37:47,342 --> 00:37:50,475
Lazima uzoefu siku zote ni mgumu.

616
00:37:50,498 --> 00:37:53,969
Sasa, kujifunza kanji kumeanza kuwa ya furaha.

617
00:37:53,993 --> 00:37:57,801
Tutafanya bidii pamoja siku zijazo.

618
00:37:57,824 --> 00:38:00,824
Mstari wa 19: Kuangalia Wakati na Mwelekeo

619
00:38:00,824 --> 00:38:05,791
Bwana Tanaka atakuja saa ngapi leo?

620
00:38:05,814 --> 00:38:10,429
Bwana Tanaka alisema atakuja saa nne.

621
00:38:10,452 --> 00:38:14,419
Sasa ni saa nne na nusu tayari.

622
00:38:14,442 --> 00:38:16,842
Amechelewa.

623
00:38:16,865 --> 00:38:20,631
Labda barabara zina msongamano.

624
00:38:20,654 --> 00:38:23,929
Alisema atakuja kwa treni?

625
00:38:23,953 --> 00:38:27,153
Alisema atakuja kwa gari.

626
00:38:27,176 --> 00:38:31,310
Mvua inaponyesha, barabara huwa na msongamano.

627
00:38:31,333 --> 00:38:36,466
Ukifuata njia hii moja kwa moja, utafika mbele ya kituo cha treni.

628
00:38:36,489 --> 00:38:41,531
Ukikata pembe hiyo, kuna njia nyembamba.

629
00:38:41,555 --> 00:38:47,034
Gari lisipopita, njia hiyo ni ya utulivu sana.

630
00:38:47,057 --> 00:38:51,591
Je, Bwana Tanaka anajua njia hiyo?

631
00:38:51,614 --> 00:38:54,385
Alisema hajui.

632
00:38:54,408 --> 00:38:57,475
Najaribu kupiga simu.

633
00:38:57,498 --> 00:38:59,670
Fanya hivyo.

634
00:38:59,693 --> 00:39:03,460
Halo, Bwana Tanaka?

635
00:39:03,483 --> 00:39:06,852
Sasa uko wapi?

636
00:39:06,875 --> 00:39:11,209
Alisema sasa yuko mbele ya kituo cha treni.

637
00:39:11,232 --> 00:39:15,246
Atakuja hapa baada ya dakika tano.

638
00:39:15,269 --> 00:39:19,436
Alisema ataleta gari karibu na eneo la kuparkia.

639
00:39:19,459 --> 00:39:24,925
Ukibonyeza kitufe hiki, mlango wa eneo la kuparkia utafunguka.

640
00:39:24,948 --> 00:39:28,982
Tukafungue mlango Bwana Tanaka anapofika.

641
00:39:29,005 --> 00:39:33,292
Basi, tutangoje hapa.

642
00:39:33,315 --> 00:39:36,315
Mstari wa 20: Zawadi na Upishi

643
00:39:36,315 --> 00:39:40,494
Saa hii ni nzuri sana, sivyo?

644
00:39:40,518 --> 00:39:42,252
Asante sana.

645
00:39:42,275 --> 00:39:46,548
Dada yangu alinipa saa hii siku ya kuzaliwa kwangu.

646
00:39:46,571 --> 00:39:49,844
Dada yako ni mtu mzuri sana.

647
00:39:49,868 --> 00:39:54,201
Mimi nilipeleka shuka kama zawadi ya shukrani.

648
00:39:54,224 --> 00:39:57,757
Dada yako alifurahi?

649
00:39:57,780 --> 00:40:00,597
Alifurahi sana.

650
00:40:00,621 --> 00:40:04,755
Unaweza kupika vizuri sana!

651
00:40:04,778 --> 00:40:07,831
Bado sijapika vizuri.

652
00:40:07,855 --> 00:40:14,666
Ulipika chakula kwa rafiki yako jana?

653
00:40:14,689 --> 00:40:20,135
Nilipika kari kwa rafiki yangu alipokuja nyumbani.

654
00:40:20,159 --> 00:40:24,032
Rafiki yako alisema nini?

655
00:40:24,055 --> 00:40:28,588
Alisema ni tamu sana na akala nyingi.

656
00:40:28,611 --> 00:40:30,978
Ni vizuri sana.

657
00:40:31,001 --> 00:40:35,434
Rafiki yangu alinipa keki.

658
00:40:35,457 --> 00:40:38,149
Ni keki ya aina gani?

659
00:40:38,173 --> 00:40:40,973
Ni keki ya Ufaransa.

660
00:40:40,996 --> 00:40:45,529
Kula keki tamu kunakufanya upate nguvu.

661
00:40:45,552 --> 00:40:48,885
Ni vizuri kula wakati wa uchovu.

662
00:40:48,908 --> 00:40:54,675
Ningependa pia nipike chakula kwa dada yangu.

663
00:40:54,698 --> 00:40:58,631
Tutakula pamoja atakapokuja dada yako.

664
00:40:58,654 --> 00:41:00,191
Asante sana.

665
00:41:00,215 --> 00:41:02,748
Dada yako atafurahi sana.